#AREA Antarctica~

#AUTHORS Mahatma~

#TEMPERATURE -50 0 30 5

#HELPS
-1 ANTARCTICA_CHANGES~
01.10.05 - Added color and effects to the Obelisk. (Mag)
~
-1 ANTARCTICAQUESTS~
{160}Quests in Antarctica{170}
--------------------

There is one quest in Antarctica.  It is for level 15 Anti-Good
equipment.  This stuff is complementary to the Sterling equipment
from Landover.  Be careful of the two or three aggressive creatures
though!  This area is also maximized for good leveling.

{160}(-){170} Back to Antarctica

{-}ANTARCTICA
~
-1 ANTARCTICA~
{170}Antarctica
{160}----------{170}

This area is the farthest south one can go in the Mortal Realms.
In the winter it is a frozen wasteland, and in the summer it is
still pretty much a frozen waste.  It is inhabited though and there
are opportunities for much adventure.  The best way to journey
to Antarctica is to fly on Griffon Airlines from the City of Entropy
or the City of Sarglam.   The snow queen rules here with an iron
fist but it is rumored that she need help with something.

This area was originally written by Mahatma and has since been
totally redone by:

{070}August 22, 1998 - Jaxom{070}
{070}August 02, 2003 - Prophecy{070}

{160}(a) {170}Antarctica Quest

{a}ANTARCTICAQUESTS
~
0 $~

