#2727
The Great Door~
You see before you a huge oaken door with adamantite trim that reads
"LITTLE HAVEN."  The rest of this place seems to be made of glass, giving
it an almost mirror-like quality.  The gnomish runes that are inscribed here
are illegible except for one that you understand: that of the Snow Queen.
There is a giant key hole here, but it looks well worn by the snow and wind.
You feel the heat of the furnace room to the south.
~
